# Who gets asked when a path changes. ADVISORY: main requires zero approvals
# and code-owner review is not enforced (settings, 2026-10-07), so an entry
# here never blocks a merge. What it does is request the other person's
# review automatically — which, for two developers whose agents do the
# talking, IS the notification that something on your surface moved. Read
# the request, or have your agent read it; nobody has to be messaged.
#
# @questionablepuddle is Sam (org admin; deploys the server, holds the OpenAI
# key and the Web Store publisher account). @merrickphan is Merrick (ships
# the desktop installers from his Windows box; Vercel website and DNS).

# Server: only Sam can put it live.
/server/                       @questionablepuddle

# Extension: either can change it; Sam uploads to the store. Its tests live
# in server/test, so the ext-* tests follow the extension, not the server.
/extension/                    @questionablepuddle @merrickphan
/server/test/ext-*.test.js     @questionablepuddle @merrickphan
/server/scripts/pack-extension.sh @questionablepuddle @merrickphan

# Desktop app, packaging and release scripts: Merrick's machine builds them.
# v0.3.76 shipped with the whole ML stack excluded and no error; a green build
# proves nothing here, so a second pair of eyes is requested.
/src/                          @merrickphan
/scripts/                      @merrickphan
/electron-builder.yml          @merrickphan
/package.json                  @merrickphan
/package-lock.json             @merrickphan
/e2e/                          @merrickphan

# The contract both agents read, and the machinery both run.
/.github/                      @questionablepuddle @merrickphan
/.claude/                      @questionablepuddle @merrickphan
/CLAUDE.md                     @questionablepuddle @merrickphan
/AGENTS.md                     @questionablepuddle @merrickphan
/CONTRIBUTING.md               @questionablepuddle @merrickphan
/STATUS.md                     @questionablepuddle @merrickphan
/docs/                         @questionablepuddle @merrickphan
